Z||000006||Shaun41178||05-05-2001||11:20 PM||||I don't think that time was traction limited at all there 88Formula.  I mean look at his 60' time.  Its a 1.9 sec.  Thats pretty darn good.  Thats what I usually get in my Fiero.  I have cut a few 1.8's but those are very hard to do, at least with my suspension setup and stock TC<P>My best time is a <BR>1.8 - 60'<BR>1/8 - 8.8  mph - 75<BR>1/4 - 14.1  mph - 90<P>Mods are a underdrive pulley, cold air intake, ported exhaust manifolds and a 70 hp shot of nitrous running through a stock auto tranny with the 3.08 gear<P>Great time there Haspers8.  <P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
